# 📊 Sales Data Analysis

A professional Data Analytics project built using **Python**, **Pandas**, and **Matplotlib** to analyze sales data and generate meaningful business insights through data visualization.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates how raw sales data can be transformed into valuable business insights using Python. It includes data analysis, visualization, and summary statistics that help understand sales performance and profitability.

---

## 🚀 Features

- 📅 Monthly Sales Trend Analysis
- 🛍️ Top 10 Products by Sales
- 🥧 Sales Distribution by Category
- 💰 Profit Analysis by City
- 📈 Statistical Summary of Sales Data
- 📊 Professional Data Visualizations

---

## 🗂️ Dataset

The dataset contains the following columns:

- Date
- Product
- Category
- City
- Sales
- Profit

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Git
- GitHub
- VS Code

---

## 📂 Project Structure

```
Sales-Data-Analysis/
│
├── data/
│   └── sales_data.csv
│
├── images/
│   ├── monthly_sales_trend.png
│   ├── top_10_products.png
│   ├── sales_by_category.png
│   └── profit_by_city.png
│
├── sales_analysis.py
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md
```

---

## ▶️ How to Run

### Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/aanand0809/Sales-Data-Analysis.git
```

### Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### Run the Project

```bash
python sales_analysis.py
```

---

## 📊 Project Outputs

The project generates the following visualizations:

- Monthly Sales Trend
- Top 10 Products by Sales
- Sales by Category (Pie Chart)
- Profit by City (Bar Chart)

All generated graphs are automatically saved in the **images/** folder.

